# The eye moon's lower lid: the bottom half of a shell round the eye (12 cm), turned forward about the eye's centre by 0.8 rad, open.
# Turning it back by that much about x closes it onto the upper lid: the engine does so to blink.
format 1

Material material=moon_lid
    Rotate rotation=(0.8, 0, 0)
        Round radius=0.004
            Intersection
                Subtraction
                    Sphere radius=0.136
                    Sphere radius=0.127
                Plane normal=(0, 1, 0) height=0.004
